# NPM Configuration

# Technical Debt: Dependency Conflict Resolution
# cloudinary@2.10.0 has peer dependency conflict with multer-storage-cloudinary@4.0.0
# which requires cloudinary@^1.21.0
#
# Decision: Keep cloudinary@2.10.0 because:
# - cloudinary@1.x has HIGH SEVERITY vulnerability (Arbitrary Argument Injection)
# - cloudinary@2.10.0 is secure and works fine with multer-storage-cloudinary@4.0.0 in practice
#
# Long-term fix: Monitor multer-storage-cloudinary for v5 that supports cloudinary@2.x
# See: https://github.com/multer-storage-cloudinary/issues
#
# This flag allows installation of peer dependencies without exact version match
legacy-peer-deps=true
